## 2. Technical Architecture & Component Breakdown

```
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                              OWNER DASHBOARD (Frontend)                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
       |                                       |                               |
       v (tab=dashboard)                       v (tab=family)                  v (tab=tree)
+-------------------------------+   +-----------------------------+   +-----------------------------+
| MemberCreationHeatmap.tsx     |   | FamilyTab.tsx               |   | TreeTab.tsx                 |
| - w-full flex-1 columns       |   | - useGetSanctuary(userId)   |   | - Global fetch (all users)  |
| - Dynamic proportional headers|   | - useGetMembers(familyId)   |   | - LandingFamilyTreeCanvas   |
| - Stretches 100% horizontally |   | - Canvas(scope='my-family') |   | - Canvas(scope='all')       |
+-------------------------------+   | - AddMember(familyId)       |   +-----------------------------+
                                    +-----------------------------+                  |
                                                   |                                 |
                                                   v (API Request with familyId)     v (API Request scope=all)
                                    +---------------------------------------------------------------+
                                    |                   familyApi.ts (RTK Query)                    |
                                    +---------------------------------------------------------------+
                                                   |
                                                   v HTTP REST Endpoints
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                  NESTJS BACKEND CONTROLLER & SERVICE                              |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 1. GET /family/sanctuary?userId=... &familyId=...                                                 |
|    -> sanctuaryData isolated to user's created family and exact count statistics                  |
|                                                                                                   |
| 2. GET /family/members?familyId=... &userId=... &paginate=false                                   |
|    -> where: { familyMemberships: { some: { familyId } } }                                        |
|                                                                                                   |
| 3. GET /family/relationships?familyId=... &userId=... &paginate=false                             |
|    -> where: { familyId }                                                                         |
|                                                                                                   |
| 4. POST /family/members                                                                           |
|    -> Automatically associates newly created member with user's target family                     |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
                                                   |
                                                   v
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                     NEON POSTGRESQL DATABASE                                      |
|  - Family Table: "The Rahman Ancestral Sanctuary" vs "this is khan family"                        |
|  - FamilyMember Table: isolated by FamilyMembership mappings                                      |
|  - Relationship Table: isolated by familyId column                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

